Source: usbdisplay-stack
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Yanhong Ma <mysticboy@live.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 linux-headers-generic,
 linux-libc-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/IoTSharp/USBDisplayStack
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/IoTSharp/USBDisplayStack
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/IoTSharp/USBDisplayStack.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: usbdisplay-stack
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ffmpeg,
 kmod,
 systemd,
 udev,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
XB-X-USBDisplay-Kernel: ${kernel:Release}
Description: USB display virtual DRM/fbdev stack
 Kernel module, frame transport daemon, Actions Micro USB-HDMI backend,
 diagnostic tools, installation scripts, and a physical-readiness checker.
 .
 This build is tied to the kernel ABI recorded in X-USBDisplay-Kernel.
 Installation does not load the module or enable the service automatically.
